$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tm2lfes2  LOC_AFTER=?

* One iteration of the entry loop with a per-entry cost: the test succeeds, the body consumes the ` J ` -th entry within ` ( Y ` J ) ` steps, the peek after it resets the test.  ~ tm2lfe2 in the Sigma-cost setting; Lean: the body argument of ` Frag.loop_runs' ` inside ` forEntries_runs' ` .

